  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1772848735_9637964_e0028d7de504dc27a977999e748be93e.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">About our brand and products:</span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br>Lucid Coast is a modern fragrance brand offering luxe-inspired perfumes, candles, and home scent products with an elevated feel and an accessible price. Our products are designed for fragrance lovers who want expensive-smelling, aesthetic essentials for everyday life.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We blend trend-forward scent vibes, beautiful packaging, and small-batch brand energy into products that feel special, giftable, and content-friendly. We’re vegan, cruelty-free, plant-based, and built for customers who love beauty, scent, and lifestyle finds that feel elevated without being out of reach.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>15% commission</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">on all qualifying sales through their custom referral link or discount code.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Share Lucid Coast in a way that feels natural to your audience — through reels, TikToks, stories, YouTube videos, product roundups, blog posts, gift guides, or lifestyle content. Great angles include fragrance favorites, everyday wear, gifting, shelf styling, self-care routines, and “smells expensive” style content.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We love working with creators in beauty, fragrance, lifestyle, and self-care. Please avoid false claims, medical claims, or wording that suggests official affiliation with any designer brands.</span></p></div></div>",
